# Operator-contact tokens for the tracked-file PII scanner (bead 3lv).
#
# Copy this file to `operator-contact.txt` (same directory) and fill in your
# real contact tokens (email addresses, phone-number fragments, handles).
# `operator-contact.txt` is GITIGNORED so your real contact never lands in
# tracked source — the trunk stays shareable.
#
# Unlike the operator NAME (accepted provenance in governance/session prose,
# scanned only on data-bearing paths), the contact has no legitimate tracked
# use and is denied TRUNK-WIDE by the commit hook.
#
# Format: one regex token per line. Blank lines and `#`-comment lines are
# ignored. Each line is compiled as a Python regex (re.DOTALL | re.IGNORECASE).
#
# Example (replace with your own; escape regex dots):
# your\.real\.email@example\.com
